      </version>
      <version name="2.0.1" author="Justin Johnson" time="2026-10-30T01:08:46Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[Lower CPU: roughly 40-50% less with a typical handful of bands and 10-15% less with 14-16, with exactly the same sound
- Bands that aren't moving skip their per-sample glide update
- The output Mid/Side gain stage is skipped when it does nothing
- Faster filter sections when many bands run in series]]></changelog>
