      <version name="2.0.2" author="Justin Johnson" time="2026-10-30T08:14:29Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[Set any value exactly with the new value stepper
- Double-click a dial, dynamics knob or toolbar field to open it: each digit has up and down arrows (hold to repeat, or use the mouse wheel over a digit), with a sign column where the value can be negative
- Changes apply as you click; values stay within each control's range; the revert icon puts back the value you started with
- Cmd+double-click (Ctrl on Windows) resets any dial, knob or field to its default, the dynamics knobs included
- Undo and automation now record the new value when you drag a panel dial]]></changelog>
        <source>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Justin-Johnson/ReJJ/v2.0.2/ReEQ2/ReEQ2.jsfx</source>
        <source file="Dependencies/ivantsov_filter.jsfx-inc">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Justin-Johnson/ReJJ/v2.0.2/ReEQ2/Dependencies/ivantsov_filter.jsfx-inc</source>
